  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint IDP Profiling Service (JIPS) - 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People and their communities are able to progress towards and reach durable solutions to displacement, supported by the collaborative efforts of governments, humanitarian and development actors that are based on high quality evidence. JIPS supports this by ensuring high quality standards and effective use of profiling and displacement data systems.</narrative>
  </description>
